title: Sink3A
---
// Talk target of Samantha's sink (Interact layer).
-> Wash up <<if visited("Route1Dinner") and not visited("Route1Dishes")>>
    <<next_scene Route1Dishes>>
-> Take the corkscrew <<if visited("Route1Thu2Door") and not visited("Route1Thu2Dinner") and $r1_thu2_wine != "" and not $r1_thu2_wine_open and not $item_corkscrew>>
    <<set $item_corkscrew to true>>
    <<note_done thu2_cork>>
    <<note thu2_cork2 "Open the wine at her table.">>
-> Look
    <<if not visited("Route1Dinner")>>
        {$samantha_name}: Dishes come after dinner. Sit down.
    <<elseif visited("Route1Thu2Door") and not visited("Route1Thu2Dinner")>>
        {$samantha_name}: Not tonight. Tonight the sink can wait.
    <<else>>
        You: Her sink. Cleaner than mine.
    <<endif>>
===
